        155
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "3 反证法"
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p24_b2",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "definition",
      "bbox": [
        90,
        185,
        660,
        225
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "反证法是数学中常用的证明方法之一. 下面，我们学习如何用反证法证明一些命题."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p24_b3",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "definition",
      "bbox": [
        90,
        230,
        660,
        320
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "在前面已经提到，要判断命题“若 $\\alpha$，则 $\\beta$”是假命题，只要存在一个满足条件 $\\alpha$ 但不满足结论 $\\beta$ 的对象就行了. 但是要判断命题“若 $\\alpha$，则 $\\beta$”是真命题，就需要证明所有满足条件 $\\alpha$ 的对象都满足结论 $\\beta$. 有时直接验证这一点并不是一件容易的事."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p24_b4",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        135,
        325,
        630,
        345
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "例 5 设 $n \\in \\mathbf{Z}$. 证明：若 $n^{2}$ 是偶数，则 $n$ 也是偶数."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p24_b5",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        90,
        350,
        660,
        395
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "证明 假设结论“$n$ 是偶数”不成立，即假设 $n$ 是奇数. 由 $n$ 是奇数，可设 $n=2k+1$，$k \\in \\mathbf{Z}$."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p24_b6",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        135,
        400,
        180,
        415
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "因为"
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p24_eq1",
      "kind": "equation",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "equation",
      "bbox": [
        180,
        420,
        570,
        440
      ],
      "anchor_id": "p24_b6",
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": null,
        "table": null,
        "equation": {
          "latex": "n^{2}=(2k+1)^{2}=4k^{2}+4k+1=4\\left(k^{2}+k\\right)+1",
          "fallback_text": "n^2 = (2k+1)^2 = 4k^2 + 4k + 1 = 4(k^2 + k) + 1"
        },
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p24_b7",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        90,
        445,
        500,
        465
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "这说明 $n^{2}$ 是奇数，与已知条件 $n^{2}$ 是偶数矛盾."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p24_b8",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        135,
        470,
        500,
        490
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "所以，一开始的假设不成立，即 $n$ 是偶数."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p24_b9",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "definition",
      "bbox": [
        90,
        500,
        660,
        585
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "例 5 的证明方法与以前的证明方法不同. 它首先假设结论 $\\beta$ 不成立（$\\beta$ 为假），然后经过正确的逻辑推理得出矛盾，从而说明“$\\beta$ 为假”是不可能发生的，即结论 $\\beta$ 是正确的. 这样的证明方法叫反证法."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p24_b10",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "definition",
      "bbox": [
        90,
        590,
        660,
        655
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "应用反证法证明命题的第一步是假设命题的结论不成立，即否定命题的结论. 这一步是十分关键的. 只有这一步表述对了，接下来的逻辑推理才有意义."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p24_b11",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "definition",
      "bbox": [
        135,
